@larsgk the PnP details for the midi device are acquired from USB. This "[Proxima Direct® USB to Midi Cable Keyboard to PC Laptop Adapter](http://www.amazon.co.uk/Proxima-Direct%C2%AE-Keyboard-Laptop-Adapter/dp/B004IJ5FEU/ref=sr_1_1?ie=UTF8&qid=1384290080&sr=8-1&keywords=midi+usb)" is what I've got here at home. 

I think we are all on the same page here and in agreement that we need the metadata to make decisions. 

I personally think that, of the three options you presented, only 1 is really viable on the web. However, we need to do some experimentation.
